{
  "description": "Groups v2 test vectors for signal-cli 0.14.7 compatibility. Companion to spec/service/groups.md. Encodings were produced offline by running the public classes of the reference distribution jars (signal-service-java-2.15.3_unofficial_151.jar Wire messages, libsignal-cli-0.14.7.jar GroupInviteLinkUrl and GroupId, libsignal-client-0.99.1.jar GroupSecretParams, okhttp Credentials) in jshell with hand-chosen dummy inputs. They are observations of the reference implementation, not upstream-published vectors, except the content_range cases, which are copied from upstream unit tests (marked).",
